# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/syncthing/fixtures/failed
# A sync the engine could not run says why, at the top, before any sync
# has finished; the setup guide is still offered.
wait-for The Syncthing engine is missing.
expect Could not start
expect Once a day
expect Set up Sync
expect-missing Last sync
clean
shot syncthing-failed
tap Set up Sync
wait-for Pair one computer folder
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Could not start
